    "sourceUi.4f6d7457964e": "(Apache-2.0) for open-source memory capabilities. Room wraps its SDK in the backend: signed-in users' memories and retrieval indexes are stored privately on this server, and relevant excerpts are sent to your chosen chat model. Mem0 cloud is not used. Guest memories stay in this browser. Disable, edit or delete memories in room settings.",
    "sourceUi.b702a1225f44": "(MIT). Thanks to these open-source projects.",
    "sourceUi.7c5bcd2c9925": "(MIT), and QR codes are generated with",
    "sourceUi.9cd500e80fd7": "(verified:",
